  "prefLabel": "Plc 1601.03 Notifications; Issuance of Registrations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1601.03 Notifications; Issuance of Registrations.\n\n(a) The OPLC shall send all notifications to applicants and registrants and all registrations issued pursuant to this chapter to the applicant’s or registrant’s designated email address.\n\n(b) All notifications and registrations sent to a designated email address for which the OPLC does not receive any indication that the email was not delivered shall be deemed to have been received by the applicant or registrant who designated the email address.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1600.html"
